dy:nth-of-type(1) > h2:nth-of-type(2)"},"b000499":{"text":"That impious maxim of the ancient philosophy, Ex nihilo, nihil fit, by which the creation of matter was excluded, ceases to be a maxim, according to this philosophy. Not only the will of the supreme Being may create matter; but, for aught we know a priori, the will of any other being might create it, or any other cause, that the most whimsical imagination can assign.","selector":"html:nth-of-type(1) > body:nth-of-type(1) > blockquote:nth-of-type(35) > div:nth-of-type(1) > p:nth-of-type(1)"},"b000037":{"text":"SECTION II","selector":"html:nth-of-type(1) > body:nth-of-type(1) > h2:nth-of-type(3)"},"b000049":{"text":"SECTION III.","selector":"html:nth-of-type(1) > body:nth-of-type(1) > h2:nth-of-type(4)"},"b000062":{"text":"SECTION IV.","selector":"html:nth-of-type(1) > body:nth-of-type(1) > h2:nth-of-type(5)"},"b000090":{"text":"SECTION V.","selector":"html:nth-of-type(1) > body:nth-of-type(1) > h2:nth-of-type(6)"},"b000121":{"text":"SECTION VI","selector":"html:nth-of-type(1) > body:nth-of-type(1) > h2:nth-of-type(7)"},"b000129":{"text":"SECTION VII.","selector":"html:nth-of-type(1) > body:nth-of-type(1) > h2:nth-of-type(8)"},"b000174":{"text":"SECTION VIII.","selector":"html:nth-of-type(1) > body:nth-of-type(1) > h2:nth-of-type(9)"},"b000217":{"text":"SECTION IX.","selector":"html:nth-of-type(1) > body:nth-of-type(1) > h2:nth-of-type(10)"},"b000227":{"text":"SECTION X","selector":"html:nth-of-type(1) > body:nth-of-type(1) > h2:nth-of-type(11)"},"b000284":{"text":"SECTION XI.","selector":"html:nth-of-type(1) > body:nth-of-type(1) > h2:nth-of-type(12)"},"b000324":{"text":"SECTION XII.","selector":"html:nth-of-type(1) > body:nth-of-type(1) > h2:nth-of-type(13)"},"b000500":{"text":"INDEX.","selector":"html:nth-of-type(1) > body:nth-of-type(1) > h2:nth-of-type(15)"}},"exclusions":[],"body_tags":["a","div","h2","h3","h4","p"],"policy":"Primary inputs include source-inspected author argument, dialogue and verse, in